@startuml behavior-change
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title Behavior Change: Become / Unbecome Pattern

participant "Sender" as sender
participant "Ref<T>" as ref
participant "Actor Goroutine" as actor
participant "BehaviorStack" as stack
participant "GoActorContext" as actx

== Initial State ==

note over stack
  **Stack: [initialHandler]**
  Depth: 1
  Current: initialHandler
end note

== Message 1: Normal Processing ==
sender -> ref : Send(ctx, msg1)
ref -> actor : Receive(ctx, msg1)
actor -> stack : Current()
stack --> actor : initialHandler
actor -> actor : initialHandler(ctx, msg1, entity)

== Message 2: Trigger Become ==
sender -> ref : Send(ctx, msg2)
ref -> actor : Receive(ctx, msg2)
actor -> stack : Current()
stack --> actor : initialHandler
actor -> actor : initialHandler(ctx, msg2, entity)

note right of actor : Inside handler, actor retrieves\nGoActorContext from context.Context

actor -> actx : GetGoActorContext[T](ctx)
actx --> actor : actorContext
actor -> actx : Become(authHandler)
actx -> stack : Become(authHandler)

note over stack
  **Stack: [initialHandler, authHandler]**
  Depth: 2
  Current: authHandler
end note

== Message 3: New Behavior Active ==
sender -> ref : Send(ctx, msg3)
ref -> actor : Receive(ctx, msg3)
actor -> stack : Current()
stack --> actor : **authHandler**
actor -> actor : authHandler(ctx, msg3, entity)

note right of actor : Now processing with\nauthHandler behavior

== Message 4: BecomeReplace ==
sender -> ref : Send(ctx, msg4)
ref -> actor : Receive(ctx, msg4)
actor -> stack : Current()
stack --> actor : authHandler
actor -> actor : authHandler(ctx, msg4, entity)
actor -> actx : BecomeReplace(adminHandler)
actx -> stack : BecomeReplace(adminHandler)

note over stack
  **Stack: [initialHandler, adminHandler]**
  Depth: 2 (unchanged)
  Current: adminHandler
  (authHandler discarded)
end note

== Message 5: Unbecome (Restore Previous) ==
sender -> ref : Send(ctx, msg5)
ref -> actor : Receive(ctx, msg5)
actor -> stack : Current()
stack --> actor : adminHandler
actor -> actor : adminHandler(ctx, msg5, entity)
actor -> actx : Unbecome()
actx -> stack : Unbecome()
stack --> actx : true (success)

note over stack
  **Stack: [initialHandler]**
  Depth: 1
  Current: initialHandler
  (back to original behavior)
end note

== Message 6: Back to Original ==
sender -> ref : Send(ctx, msg6)
ref -> actor : Receive(ctx, msg6)
actor -> stack : Current()
stack --> actor : **initialHandler**
actor -> actor : initialHandler(ctx, msg6, entity)

== Unbecome at Base (No-Op) ==
actor -> actx : Unbecome()
actx -> stack : Unbecome()
stack --> actx : false (cannot pop base handler)

note over stack
  **Stack: [initialHandler]**
  Base handler is never removed.
  Unbecome returns false.
end note

note over actor, stack
  **Key Properties:**
  • BehaviorStack is only accessed from within the actor's goroutine (no sync needed)
  • GoActorContext is injected via context.WithValue at Start()
  • Become pushes (preserves previous), BecomeReplace swaps top (discards previous)
  • Unbecome pops to restore previous; returns false at base
  • Middleware wraps the current behavior — chain is applied once at startup
end note

@enduml
